 class’ user should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set the addButtonItem property of the section to a valid UIBarButtonItem, the section then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will automatically add new items when the button is tapped."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"SCArrayOfItemsSection","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SCArrayOfItemsSection"}}}